{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026l3Z6GQCQeK1794209470.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>山西省太原市一棟高層建築發生火警，至少14人死亡。</p><p></p><p>事發在昨日下午約5時，網上片段見到涉事建築物高層冒出大量火舌，有人在窗邊求救，周圍黑煙四起，消防到場灌救。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.FIRE-1300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Gy4aXDeMvs1794205237.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>新華社指，起火建築是太原市迎澤區柳巷街道的豪生國際公寓，據報內有酒店。有傳媒引述逃生者稱，事發時酒店無任何警報，而消防通道阻塞無法下樓。當局指已成立調查專班調查事故原因，將會統一發布。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:21:57.422271+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T05:43:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T10:56:10.078151+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:15:43.555154+00:00","content_hash":"b368c4265a23f7af6d80fd1f280df943122ab5c90f515659972e73cc62b1638d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}